kind: note
tags: business-plan conventions workflow-page-template
Conventions workflow page template
title end

paragraph start
A workflow page describes one repeatable process from trigger to finished result. It uses the plan file type, which requires Goal, Steps, Done when and Open questions in that order.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Each step is one action that can be finished and checked. The page names who does the step, a person or an AI, so automation can be added later.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
title start
kind: plan
tags: business-plan AREAKEY workflow
Name of the process
title end

section start
title start
Goal
title end
paragraph start
The finished result as one outcome.
paragraph end
section end

Steps, Done when and Open questions follow in the same shape.
code end

